# Cloudflare Pages header rules.
#
# PREVIEW ONLY. This block exists so that *.pages.dev previews cannot be
# indexed while apocalab.com still points elsewhere. Remove it the moment the
# site is served from its real domain — otherwise production inherits noindex
# and the site silently drops out of every search engine.
#
# Keep in sync with: scripts/check_site.py (asserts this line is present, so
# deleting the file is a build failure, not an afterthought).

/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex

# Pages serves unknown extensions as application/octet-stream. The map's
# fallback outline is fetched with res.json(), which ignores the header — but a
# wrong Content-Type is the kind of thing that bites a cache or a proxy later.

/ne_110m_land.geojson
  Content-Type: application/json; charset=utf-8
